<head>
<no><b>Schedule 1</b></no><heading
guid="_c9fc0988-029d-4eb7-ad43-7c4b2cca3c41" id="sch.1-he"><b>Constitution and
procedure of Board</b></heading></head>
<block align="right" type="sourceref"><txt>section 6(4)</txt></block>

<level type="part" id="sch.1-pt.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_60e70747-79f0-453d-a834-052b73be49bd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-pt.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 1</b></no><heading guid="_2d1b9d24-f40c-4c0c-ae79-739debed735b"
id="sch.1-pt.1-he"><b>Constitution</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fcdac312-ecd9-470d-a9d6-1aefced1622c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_cc3d7ae9-7bac-4dda-829e-a7ad4f9b0fa5"
id="sch.1-sec.1-he"><b>Terms of office of members</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8549aadb-9e79-4f23-86b4-8109f826bbd3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to this schedule or the regulations, a
member holds office for the term, not more than 3 years, specified in the
instrument of appointment.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8c52205f-bc97-4945-a47f-22531c177ba2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A member is eligible, if otherwise qualified, for
re-appointment.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ec4e3d63-036f-4db0-91fb-612dca5c545d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_26ad5f88-c22b-476b-88a8-27ecde06e803"
id="sch.1-sec.2-he"><b>Part-time appointments</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Members hold office as part-time
members.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_92b9a2a3-d479-4e9e-bd99-8131fca38b6f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_9d88fc68-4320-4a07-89a4-0997b2d6660a"
id="sch.1-sec.3-he"><b>Remuneration</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A member is entitled to be paid the remuneration,
including allowances, determined by the Minister.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2a3161b3-26c6-47fd-8eee-f1e1d89239d5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_96655f09-4ad2-4f1d-a10c-b73f71955c25"
id="sch.1-sec.4-he"><b>Vacancy in office of member</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The office of an appointed member becomes vacant
if the member&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_224b9c6b-9b7f-4ba2-8fd0-fff13a00ae18" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">dies, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0cdffb57-03c6-450c-b56a-e8881d10cbf0" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">completes a term of office and is not
re-appointed, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a78a0352-a4bc-4822-a298-668a6dc46d59" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">resigns the office by written instrument
addressed to the Minister, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_60954a85-283f-4136-a740-1298a99b3950" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is removed from office by the Minister under this
section, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6cb05d4f-4ef4-494b-8b35-abdbd08245c6" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is absent from 3 consecutive meetings of the
Board of which reasonable notice has been given to the member, except if the
member is&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_975b7240-0f95-49ad-8435-cbed7ba1951d"
id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.e-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">on leave granted by the Minister,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d5867191-9095-4a75-8941-d56f62f71039"
id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.e-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">excused by the chairperson for having been absent
from the meetings, or</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bbb56188-ee48-4ba0-b60c-aef49cfb78e8" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">becomes personally insolvent,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8b4da7a1-3916-42cb-8d1f-792f522ec45e" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">becomes a mentally incapacitated person,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c55c349f-bc0f-42bf-a964-c4e5c56b2b07" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.h">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is convicted&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f664509f-b105-4057-9d6d-7ecf032a3dd6"
id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.h-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in New South Wales of an offence punishable by
imprisonment for 12 months or more, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2a05d247-0232-46f8-ba8a-c2fc5815a23d"
id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.h-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">elsewhere of an offence that, if committed in New
South Wales, would be an offence punishable by imprisonment for 12 months or
more.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_70d9ffbb-7b63-49e7-b50c-dd67d4a0fd43"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_5236f5af-c2a6-4b3f-bfea-202d990c2cdb"
id="sch.1-sec.5-he"><b>Filling of vacancy in office of appointed
member</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If the office of a member becomes vacant, a
person is, subject to this Act and the regulations, to be appointed to fill
the vacancy.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_998a95c3-3935-4aa3-bbae-151c8e83e77d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_0d7c90fa-467a-400d-b4ce-39127bb99566"
id="sch.1-sec.6-he"><b>Vacancy in office of chairperson and deputy
chairperson</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The chairperson or deputy chairperson vacates
office as chairperson or deputy chairperson if the chairperson or deputy
chairperson&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2a3f7167-92af-4a16-8cd0-cb21989c4e82" id="sch.1-sec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">is removed from office by the Minister under this
section, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_40d3bd83-b867-48e4-9d62-77aa98c64250" id="sch.1-sec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">resigns office by written instrument addressed to
the Minister, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9dd49d35-451e-40ec-bf79-15ebb0368f07" id="sch.1-sec.6-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">ceases to be a member of the
Board.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_31fc482f-ad9b-4461-8189-0cc62ed02dd0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_e1ed9491-00ef-4c29-94e1-d4b2e09bfc3f"
id="sch.1-sec.7-he"><b>Disclosure of pecuniary interests</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f6e30a76-382f-4b63-b51f-9fb322fc6438"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section applies if&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_0ed3fd31-a0e1-4da7-9c72-7de41d8f0b8e" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a member has a direct or indirect pecuniary
interest in a matter that is being considered or is about to be considered at
a meeting of the Board, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_68d37669-a831-49a6-8eba-dfd0cd8eeb2a" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the interest appears to raise a conflict with the
proper performance of the member&#8217;s duties in relation to the
consideration of the matter.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_920793cb-d1bb-4d5c-bd75-5668bd85cdef"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The member must, as soon as practicable after
becoming aware of the relevant facts, disclose the nature of the interest at a
meeting of the Board.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bbe6c3bc-a1e6-44c2-8e69-d6898a3c35ac"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Particulars of a disclosure made under this
section must be recorded by the Board.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_8cec9cd5-542f-4076-bd56-bba18e5a9ab6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The record must be made available to a person for
inspection at all reasonable hours.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2fa294c6-93e0-450a-820e-308e92a4c6dd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">After a member has disclosed the nature of an
interest in a matter, the member must not, unless the Minister or the Board
otherwise determines&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_40fdb3f1-0462-4f7d-b9f5-d3364b2f4564" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.5-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">be present during a deliberation of the Board
about the matter, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_958feb1b-62f2-4df0-bded-4dad72ce2a16" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.5-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">take part in a decision of the Board about the
matter.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e1d0aa52-22c8-4676-9ba0-d3c5434a1b25"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purpose of the making of a determination
by the Board under subsection (5), a member who has a direct or indirect
pecuniary interest in a matter to which the disclosure relates must
not&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_ceecf022-9d11-4ff2-b277-4dfd018ce5f1" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">be present during any deliberation of the Board
for the purpose of making the determination, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_db6fa8e0-b154-485b-95df-c81c9c33ce1c" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">take part in the making of the
determination.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b5f6808c-c15e-46a2-814c-c6ee753d2503"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.7-ssec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(7)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A contravention of this section does not
invalidate a decision of the Board.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_74451e92-5575-4570-892a-bcadb34ff682"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_cb7598bd-30ac-4023-8eb7-c04fa9bd452d"
id="sch.1-sec.8-he"><b>Effect of certain other Acts</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7a70bfbc-eacb-4c03-804e-6767bcc851ca"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The provisions of the <legref
refid="act-2013-040" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Government Sector Employment Act 2013</i></name></legref>
relating to the employment of Public Service employees do not apply to a
member.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e77d07a2-0a77-4e15-979b-216636bd8a93"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">If by or under any Act provision is made for
either of the following, the provision does not operate to disqualify a person
from holding the office and also the office of a member, or from accepting and
retaining remuneration payable to the person under this Act as a
member&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a76f8107-3230-4d49-8268-b162c8b34556" id="sch.1-sec.8-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">requiring a person who is the holder of a
specified office to devote the whole of the person&#8217;s time to the duties
of the office,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_e4f414c9-2af5-468e-97aa-4a6d5eb4a29b" id="sch.1-sec.8-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">prohibiting the person from engaging in
employment outside the duties of the office.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2eb13044-d36b-4519-86ac-dc5e18e52784"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_9585fe10-f36a-44bf-bbb5-3bf982210106"
id="sch.1-sec.9-he"><b>Personal liability</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A matter or thing done or omitted to be done by
the Board or a member does not, if the matter or thing was done or omitted to
be done in good faith for the purpose of executing this Act or another Act,
subject a member personally to an action, liability, claim or
demand.</txt></block></level>
</level>


